v0.1.8.2-beta — Independent Secondary Providers + Auto-Consolidation + Bug Fixes

Secondary Providers:
- Secondary providers now have their own dedicated configuration section
- Full CRUD: add, edit, delete secondary providers independently
- Each secondary provider has its own type, URL, API key, model, and settings
- Primary providers select which secondary provider to use via dropdown

Auto-Consolidation:
- New auto-consolidation scheduler for automated memory maintenance
- Configurable schedule: daily or weekly
- Configurable hour (0-23) for when consolidation runs
- Background task checks config every minute and runs at scheduled time

Bug Fixes:
- Fix HTTP 500 on tool calls (e.g. HA commands) with Grok and other providers
  that return content:null on assistant messages with tool_calls
- Changed all .get("content", "") to .get("content") or "" across chat.py
  and memory_engine.py to handle None values safely

i18n:
- All new UI strings translated in both EN and RO
